DECL	{"args":[{"name":"a","sort":{"sort":"track"}},{"name":"r","sort":{"sort":"region"}}],"body":{"and":[{"rises":{"not":{"args":[{"var":"a"},{"var":"r"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}}},{"and":[{"cmp":"ge","lhs":{"heading_since":"a","max_step":{"param":"step"},"onset":{"args":[{"var":"a"},{"var":"r"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}},"rhs":{"param":"turn_min"}},{"cmp":"lt","lhs":{"heading_since":"a","max_step":{"param":"step"},"onset":{"args":[{"var":"a"},{"var":"r"}],"atom":"rel_occupies","params":[]}},"rhs":{"param":"u_turn_min"}}]}]},"contract":"Road user a has made a turn to the left through region r, recognized as it leaves r. The act begins at the observation at which a's footprint came to overlap r (rel.occupies), having not overlapped it at the previous observation: its entry into r. The act is recognized at the observation at which a's footprint does not overlap r, having overlapped it at the previous observation: its exit from r. The concept holds at that observation only, and not again until a has entered r again and left it. At that observation the heading change of a since its entry into r, in degrees and positive to the left, integrated from its yaw rate (kin.yaw_rate) with no interval between consecutive observations longer than step, lies in the band from turn_min inclusive to u_turn_min exclusive, so that a passage whose heading changes too little to be a turn and a reversal of direction both lie outside it. Conduct before the entry is not read. It denotes the change of a's heading between its entry into r and its exit only: it says nothing of the lanes a uses, of its speed, of its class, or of why it turns. Not denoted: a passage through r whose heading change is below turn_min, such as one straight through or a turn to the right; a heading change of u_turn_min or more, which is a reversal of direction; an observation at which a is still in r. Where the entry was not observed (it lies before the recording, or a's overlap with r was unknown at an observation since), where an interval between consecutive observations since the observation before the entry is longer than step, or where a yaw rate since the entry is missing, it is unknown.","definition":null,"id":"drv.motion.left_turn_through_region","kind":"formula","narrowings":[],"params":[{"name":"step","unit":"second"},{"name":"turn_min","unit":"degree"},{"name":"u_turn_min","unit":"degree"}],"residues":[],"supersedes":null}
ATOMS	rel_occupies,kin_yaw_rate,kin_time
